Error [jet.ReservedRootShadowed]: `core` is reserved for first-party or foreign packages
  --> tests/ui/core_reserved_shadow.jet:1:5
    |
  1 | use core: "./core_reserved_shadow/scoring"
    |     ^^^^
 Why: `core`, `jet`, first-party ring names, and foreign-language roots can't be used for local modules
 Fix: Rename the module, or import it as `other_name: …`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1002
